lfD0tVjYtXMQ7kNvwErh5y1&_nc_oc=AdrJoAjGb3vdtajlsgd9_oCwOtChJMN4qo0M3QE9jJ-ilZE-Yhl1y5aAVzecuqggsVc&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-sjc3-1.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7f20f&oh=00_AQCe0sk10_hVoEq5BnEjRHL5u7kyHtuBvpH-U47IFa4cpw&oe=6A6DFF37"}, {"file_name": "04.png", "id": "771918482106759", "uri": "https://scontent-sjc6-1.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/499619465_771918485440092_2131832106720639880_n.png?_nc_cat=108&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=aUHi7YN0UB4Q7kNvwGuL-ze&_nc_oc=AdrYCiJgg-rD3OQ_aLhbbER1_SefLekwRV30B8L_DP-ykku7cGTI7PcHAx7_eE5qwN0&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-sjc6-1.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7f20f&oh=00_AQAICpiwjNKXSfxKL1GZ9lV_luRxwtJCg36nGv5bHzvPqg&oe=6A6E00CA"}, {"file_name": "05.png", "id": "24094775356867679", "uri": "https://scontent-sjc6-1.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/499298543_24094775363534345_8848995430294496546_n.png?_nc_cat=102&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=6yb3MLqOV04Q7kNvwEpTHCW&_nc_oc=Adr425Ap-GRnjowrtyP06g20tMzzkVaNP7UIhZvtSIo541wem7C7IZULxozYvqM8-us&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-sjc6-1.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7f20f&oh=00_AQCwkHdg0lDgstI4FJhRy3tTlHl3fYOSjj436aOFrIb_Bg&oe=6A6DEDEF"}], "video_trailer": null, "video_trailer_thumbnail": null, "display_name": "MOKNVG", "keywords": ["Nightvision", "NVG"], "long_description": "# Simulated Night Vision Experience\nThe MOKNVG simulates dummy night vision effect with realistic device operations, offering an immersive and interactive experience.\n\n**Features**\n- Customizable dummy NVG effect (with color adjustment)\n- Fully interactable NVG device functions\n- Supports both controller and hand interactions\n- Adjustable focus effect and DoF center mask for aiming with optics(Quest 3 only)\n\n**Interactable Controls**\n- Flip-down\n- Forward / Back adjustment\n- Side flip rotation\n- Left / Right switch\n- Pod power switch\n- Focus control\n- Manual gain control\n\n**Current available NVG type**\n- Monocular  NVG\n\n**Notice**\n- Current camera input has a 40\u201360 ms delay\n-  Input image is not fully accurate due to limitations in the API used during app development\n\n- Play safe and watch your surroundings!\n\n**Requred Device** \n- Quest 3 / Quest 3S\n- Must be running Horizon OS v74 or higher", "short_description": "MOKNVG simulates dummy night vision effect with realistic device operations, offering an immersive and interactive experience."}, {"images": {"nodes": [{"file_name": "Logo_01.png", "id": "24692493507105236", "image_type": "APP_IMG_LOGO_TRANSPARENT", "uri": "https://scontent-sjc3-1.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/491825041_24692493510438569_5662868901094719245_n.png?_nc_cat=105&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=GVYi-brJLW4Q7kNvwHEA_-d&_nc_oc=AdolqTDyrB3t1T0_8EdbJGZFAEAJe8zLlB4halrNX8pbnPF_zxgOV95enZkTdMDknGA&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-sjc3-1.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7f20f&oh=00_AQA4WezbRPxWGnswkmQhVLMIjmIJN47AnPXOUA0U-vEHKg&oe=6A6DD743"}, {"file_name": "Cover_Landscape_2560x1440_01.png", "id": "1831122448283491", "image_type": "APP_IMG_COVER_LANDSCAPE", "uri": "https://scontent-sjc3-1.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/499618984_1831122454950157_3916287305954730484_n.png?_nc_cat=103&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=7IzrMR_nIcAQ7kNvwFfI_KB&_nc_oc=Adq98rMm1rq2T6Ak6Da49W6XUEcji4AsouCnadeR5KxsFuB4DM4_DwZLWRypKfbEWdc&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-sjc3-1.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7f20f&oh=00_AQBhjDHUrkeT5qxXwbcS0ivMWhpZp_n2Br32abciEi2TAw&oe=6A6E07D8"}, {"file_name": "Icon_512x512.png", "id": "1686371038722132", "image_type": "APP_IMG_ICON", "uri": "https://scontent-sjc6-1.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/491831798_1686371042055465_2000336760327949752_n.png?_nc_cat=107&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=WQY9aw3ZhFkQ7kNvwGdX2tc&_nc_oc=Adr1jlTU28Tbfjb2Z63JN3G60_seIrxCJS790H0KD7zLscbH0Fdq8EkQB6KJqqVg3yQ&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-sjc6-1.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7f20f&oh=00_AQDn2c-YCwbitR4Uu-kaJwzJRHYk-xwDkCE4MYb9ej27vA&oe=6A6DE2BC"}, {"file_name": "Cover_Square_1440x1440_01.png", "id": "1338680584514953", "image_type": "APP_IMG_COVER_SQUARE", "uri": "https://scontent-sjc6-1.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/499619594_1338680587848286_62080